{{Faction | faction = Opposition | image1 = SectOpposition.png | caption-image1 = | nickname = Opposers | philosophy = Anything can be defined by its opposite; opposites give meaning. | founded = | factol = | sigilhq = | homefield = [[Inner Planes]], mostly the [[Elemental Plane of Air]] | allies = [[Believers of the Source]], [[Bleak Cabal]], and [[Fated]] find points of agreement, but Opposers want no allies. | enemies = Pretty much everyone | predecessor = | successor = }}
The '''Opposition''' are a [[sect]] mostly found on the Inner Planes, who believe in the power of opposites. Without something to oppose -- something to struggle against -- a thing becomes weak. Therefore, they make themselves the enemy of most of those who they encounter, not out of malice, but out of a desire to improve both.
== History ==
== Philosophy ==
Whatever you think is wrong. Greatness comes from hardship, and hardship is brought about by conflict. Everything is honed to perfection by clashing with its opposite. Agreement is weakness.
== Role ==
== Membership ==
Only those who are true neutral may join.
== Background Information ==
== References == * {{b|Planescape|Planescape Monstrous Compendium Appendix III|pdf=17294|page=66-67}}
