{{Faction | faction = The Order of the Planes-Militant | image1 = SectOrderofthePlanesMilitant2e.png | caption-image1 = | nickname = The Children of Heaven, the Brethren, the Faithful | philosophy = Defend Mount Celestia at all costs | founded = [[874 BFHR]] | factol = Prefect [[Increase VII]] | sigilhq = | homefield = [[Mount Celestia]] | allies = [[Fraternity of Order]], [[Harmonium]] | enemies = [[Athar]], [[Fated]], [[Doomguard]] | predecessor = | successor = }}
The '''Order of the Planes-Militant''' are a [[sect]] dedicated to the protection and defenses of Mount Celestia, which they see as a mighty fortress. Members raid the lower planes, fight evil and chaos within neutral boundary territories like Mechanus and Acheron, and expand their holdings by shifting territory over from Arcadia and the Outlands.
